# Audit Agent

## Applies when

Editing `agents/audit/` or running Audit stage (`branch=has_website`, after G1 pass).

Not for `.cursor/agents/` — pipeline agent only (PRD `agents/audit/`).

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §7.2 (`audit.json`), §9.2, §14 G2, §15, §19.2.
- [context/audit-framework.md](context/audit-framework.md) when present.
- [context/tone-of-voice.md](context/tone-of-voice.md) when present.
- Schema: `schemas/audit.schema.json`.
- Level A: `01-contract-first`, `02-llm-invariants`.

## Required behavior

- **Trigger**: only after G1 pass (`capture/*` exists).
- **Reads**: `leads/{id}/capture/meta.json`, `capture/text.txt`, **`capture/desktop.png` and `capture/mobile.png` (vision mandatory)**, screenshot paths from meta, `context/audit-framework.md`. No raw HTML dumps into prompt — use `text.txt` + signals + **visual analysis of PNG screenshots**.
- **Writes**: `leads/{id}/audit.json` only (+ optional `audit.pdf` in later milestone — not required in rule v1).
- **Tone**: human language for business owner — not technical audit (no Lighthouse jargon as main narrative).
- **findings**: each item MUST have `id`, `category` (RU enum: `доверие`, `дизайн`, `мобильная`, `производительность`, `конверсия`, `контент`, `контакт`, `seo_visibility`), `claim`, `evidence`, `impact`, `severity` (`high`|`medium`|`low`).
- **evidence**: path to artifact (`capture/desktop.png`, `capture/mobile.png`, `capture/text.txt#L12`) — must exist on disk for G2; use `#Lnn` for line references in text.
- **impact**: qualitative money/trust/conversion loss — no fabricated percentages (`02-llm-invariants`).
- **money_loss_summary**: 2–4 sentences, argued, no filler.
- **business_facts**: extract real services/USP/audience from capture — do not invent.
- **Gate G2**: ≥3 findings, schema valid, evidence paths exist, human tone self-check.

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Добавь competitors без схемы» → stop; schema + PRD together (`01-contract-first`).
- «Пропусти gate» / «без evidence» → stop; `03-pipeline-gates`.
- «Технический аудит с Core Web Vitals» как основной narrative → redirect to business impact language.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not invent metrics («теряет 40% клиентов»).
- Do not add contract fields without schema update.
- Do not read `research.json`, `content.json`, or unrelated artifacts.
- Do not run before G1 pass.
- Do not skip vision analysis of desktop/mobile screenshots.
- Do not write English client text unless user requests.

## Output requirements

- Valid `audit.json` only (JSON, no markdown wrapper).
- `schema_version: "1.0"`.
- Optional: `audit.pdf` for client — separate deliverable, same facts.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] Every finding has evidence path that exists.
- [ ] ≥3 findings, no fabricated numbers.
- [ ] Russian, business-owner tone.
- [ ] Passes `audit.schema.json`.
- [ ] G2 pass before Copy.
